---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import manifest from '../../public/asset-manifest.json';
import { rooms } from '../data/content';
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const official='https://www.sixsenses.com/en/hotels-resorts/europe/spain/ibiza/';
---
<Layout title="Photography & Sources | Six Senses Ibiza — Independent Concept" description="Photography licensing, original creators, factual sources and transparency for an independent Six Senses Ibiza portfolio concept. Not affiliated with Six Senses.">
  <header class="site-header is-scrolled"><a class="wordmark" href={base}><span class="wordmark-name">SIX SENSES</span><span class="wordmark-place">IBIZA · A DESIGN STUDY</span></a><a class="text-link" href={base}>Back to Ibiza <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></header>
  <main class="credits section-pad" id="main"><span class="eyebrow">TRANSPARENCY & ACKNOWLEDGMENTS</span><h1 class="display">THE PEOPLE<br />BEHIND THE <em>PICTURES.</em></h1><p><strong>Independent Portfolio Concept — Not affiliated with Six Senses.</strong></p><p>This independent, noncommercial design and frontend portfolio study by Filip Nedelkoski is inspired by Six Senses Ibiza. It is not the official resort website and has no commercial relationship with the brand. Six Senses is a trademark of its respective owner. The original sun illustration and typographic presentation created for this study are not official brand assets.</p><h2>Photography</h2><p>All photography is used under the <a href="https://www.pexels.com/license/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Pexels License</a>. Photographs illustrate a Mediterranean visual atmosphere. Room, spa, dining and alternative resort images do not depict Six Senses Ibiza. Ibiza destination photographs do not necessarily depict Cala Xarraca. Captions below preserve each source’s actual location.</p><ul>{manifest.assets.map(asset=><li><a href={asset.sourceURL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{asset.description}</a> — {asset.author}.<br />{asset.visualDepiction}</li>)}</ul><h2>Resort information</h2><p>Accommodation names, sizes, occupancy limits and amenities were checked against the official Six Senses website on 22 October 2026. Areas are total indoor and outdoor space unless stated otherwise. Information may change; check the official website before planning travel.</p><ul>{rooms.map(room=><li><a href={room.source} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{room.name}</a></li>)}{[['Destination','destination/'],['Wellness & Spa','wellness-spa/'],['Dining','dining/'],['Experiences','experiences/'],['Sustainability','sustainability/']].map(([name,path])=><li><a href={official+path} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{name}</a></li>)}</ul><h2>Reservations demonstration</h2><p>The planning form stores no data and sends no requests. It does not access availability, quote prices or create reservations. The official handoff opens the <a href={`${official}accommodation/`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Six Senses Ibiza accommodations and booking page</a>; dates and other preferences must be entered again there.</p><h2>Type & technology</h2><p>Cormorant Garamond and DM Sans are served locally via Fontsource under the SIL Open Font License (<a href={`${base}fonts/OFL-Cormorant-Garamond.txt`}>Cormorant license</a>, <a href={`${base}fonts/OFL-DM-Sans.txt`}>DM Sans license</a>). Built with Astro, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, React and GSAP ScrollTrigger.</p><a class="text-link" href={base}>Back to Ibiza <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></main>
</Layout>
